<% layout('layout') -%>
<section class="hero"><div class="eyebrow">ONE PLATFORM · LOCAL MARKETS</div><h1><%= t.tagline %></h1><p>Parcel requests, country-aware experiences, language choices and helpful guidance — in one place.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/book-parcel"><%= t.startBooking %></a><a class="button secondary" href="/track"><%= t.trackBooking %></a></div><p class="notice"><%= t.bookingDisclaimer %></p></section>
<section class="grid"><article class="feature"><div class="icon">◎</div><h2>Local-first delivery</h2><p>Sender and receiver country, state and postal code are captured separately for routing decisions.</p></article><article class="feature"><div class="icon">文</div><h2>Language choice</h2><p>Choose from available language dictionaries. Important legal and carrier content still needs review.</p></article><article class="feature"><div class="icon">✦</div><h2>AI parcel helper</h2><p>Ask about packing, booking details and tracking terms. It never pretends a carrier has confirmed a shipment.</p></article></section>
<section class="panel"><h2>Need help?</h2><p>Use the assistant to learn what details a carrier usually needs. Real shipping prices and confirmed labels require a connected courier provider.</p><form id="assistant-form"><label for="question">Ask Stratic Assistant</label><textarea id="question" maxlength="2000" required placeholder="How should I pack a fragile parcel?"></textarea><button class="button primary" type="submit">Ask assistant</button></form><p id="assistant-answer" role="status"></p></section>

<section class="panel"><h2>Test global parcel languages</h2><p>Use two phones to test how the same shared demo parcel appears in each person’s selected language. No login is required for this test.</p><a class="button primary" href="/language-test">Open language test</a></section>
